  "description": "A high-performance, enterprise-grade, lightweight foundation package for Domain-Driven Design (DDD) and Event Sourcing (ES) patterns in modern .NET ecosystems. Provides pristine core abstractions including Entity, AggregateRoot, ValueObject, Domain Events, Smart Enums (Enumeration), Specifications, Sagas, Projections, Auditing, Multi-Tenancy, and Structured Domain Exceptions with machine-readable ErrorCode, Severity categorization, and contextual Details.",
